      "title_at_revision": "Shock absorption tests",
      "text": "The landing inertia load factor and the reserve energy absorption capacity of the landing gear m ust be substantiated by the tests prescribed in CS 29.725 and 29.727, respectively . These tests m ust be conducted on the complete rotorcraft or on units consisting of wheel, ty re, and shock absorber in their proper relation.",
